      "slug": "tikka-meaning",
      "term": "Tikka",
      "definition": "Means small piece in Hindi, originally from the Persian. Tikka describes a method where small pieces of boneless meat are marinated in spiced yogurt and cooked over high heat, typically in a clay tandoor oven."
    }
