            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is yogurt-marinated chicken grilled until the outside caramelises and the yogurt coating chars in places. It is served dry on skewers with raw onion and lemon, not in a sauce. The marinade takes 2 minutes to mix; the marinating time is what matters. Two hours is the minimum; overnight gives better results."
          }
        ]
      },
